:: Thomas Ask About Classmate Lucas [nobr]

<<set $Minutes += 1>>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
            },
        },
        {
            Name: "Thomas",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Uniform",
            },
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

<<if !$CompletedQuests.includes("Thomas: Out Sick")>>
    You ask <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Thomas</span> what he thinks of <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span>. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“He’s an idiot who let his emotions get the better of him.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Thomas</span> replies sharply. Confused, you ask him what he means, but <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Thomas</span> just scoffs and begins to walk away. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Yeah, I’m not getting involved in that.”</span> <br>
    <br>
<<elseif !$CompletedQuests.includes("Lucas: Punishment Game")>>
    You ask <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Thomas</span> what he thinks of <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> and he sighs. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Kid’s an idiot. Made a mistake and then decided to just live with it. But hey, I get it if he wants to be alone.”</span> You ask <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Thomas</span> what he is talking about and he shrugs. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“That’s not my story to tell. If you’re his friend, he’ll tell you when he wants to.”</span> <br>
    <br>
<<else>>
    You ask <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Thomas</span> what he thinks of <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> and he sighs. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Kid’s an idiot, no offense to your friend. I’m sure you know about all the <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Ryker</span> stuff? <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Ryker</span> was always an ass and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> followed him like a little puppy. Honestly, once he started making other friends it was bound to happen. Kids like <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Ryker</span> always get jealous. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> is just stupid for not seeing it.”</span> <br>
    <br>
<</if>><br>
<br>
<<endByLocation>>

